# Charming Scoundrel's first mode: "Discard a card, then draw a card" (CR 701.9, 121.1). Bot1 discards the Mountain it picks and draws the
# top card of its library, an Ornithopter: the hand is the same size. The discard is a choice among the cards still in hand.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Charming Scoundrel
Mountain
Ornithopter
Mountain x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Charming Scoundrel.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Modes(1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Mountain)
? Bot1.Graveyard = Mountain; Black Lotus
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 5

[Expect]
Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Battlefield = Charming Scoundrel
